  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1462913/description_d9b19996-97b3-4fbf-8c79-b3c1ae14b22d.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此資源包是 <strong>深色模式</strong> 擴充套件，適用於 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ae2-blackout\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Blackout</a></strong>，並為多個附加模組新增貼圖支援。</p>\n<p><strong>支援的附加模組：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-lightning-tech\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AE2 Lightning Tech</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-experienced\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Applied Experienced</strong></a></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Generators</a><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-history\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied History</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-energistique\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars &Eacute;nergistique</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/data-energistics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Data Energistics</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-ae\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded AE</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/growth-accelerator-tiers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Growth Accelerator Tiers</a></strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/me-beam-former\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>ME Beam Former</strong></a></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neo-eco-ae-extension\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neo ECO AE Extension</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/replication-ae2-bridge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Replication AE2 Bridge</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意事項：</strong></p>\n<p>本資源包中的多數貼圖均基於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ae2-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AE2 Dark Mode</strong></a>。此外還包含了額外的修復與改進。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歡迎透過 Discord 與我聯繫：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>floppos</li>\n</ul>",
